ls-3 gap-8\">\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Double Skin AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">The preferred choice for Panchmahal&#8217;s manufacturing units. We specialize in panel sealing, insulation repair, and blower motor maintenance.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-yellow-500 font-bold\">Industrial HVAC &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-green-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Hygienic / Pharma AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Critical for sterile environments in food and pharma industries near Halol. Includes HEPA filter validation and deep sanitization.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-green-500 font-bold\">Cold Chain &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-blue-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Vertical AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Space-efficient cooling for Godhra&#8217;s commercial banks and retail centers. We handle motor replacement and vibration isolation.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 font-bold\">Commercial AC &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- INDUSTRIAL FOCUS SECTION (Godhra Specific) -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-gray-900\">Dedicated Service for Godhra Industrial Estates &#038; GIDC Parks</h2>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg\">\n                <p class=\"mb-6 text-lg text-justify\">\n                    Godhra is a pivotal industrial node in Gujarat, hosting a variety of manufacturing and processing plants. Atlas Aircon offers specialized <b>Air Handling Unit services Godhra</b> designed to meet the high-static and heavy-load requirements of these factories. From the <b>Godhra GIDC</b> to the industrial corridors of <b>Halol</b> and <b>Kalol</b>, our expert technicians ensure your cooling infrastructure is efficient and reliable.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-blue-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-industry mr-2\"></i> Major Industrial &#038; GIDC Estates</h4>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Godhra GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Halol GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Kalol GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Chandrapura Industrial Area</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Baska Industrial Estate</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Tajpura Industrial Park</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Panchmahal Industrial Hub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-green-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-warehouse mr-2\"></i> Local Service Zones</h4>\n                        <ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm\">\n                            <li>Prabha Road Area</li>\n                            <li>Polan Bazar Hub</li>\n                            <li>Civil Lines Commercial</li>\n                            <li>Vavdi Buzarg Area</li>\n                            <li>Bamroli Road Estates</li>\n                            <li>Godhra-Dahod Road Hub</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PRICE TABLE -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">AHU Spare Parts &#038; Service Price List (Godhra Region)</h2>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white uppercase text-sm\">\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">AHU Maintenance Item / Service</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Estimated Cost</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Product Link</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>AHU Preventive Maintenance (General Service)</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 1,700 &#8211; 4,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/shop\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Book Service</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Pre-Filter</b> (Standard Washable)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 450 &#8211; 1,500</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/pre-filter\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Buy Spares</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>HEPA Filter</b> (Pharma / Food Grade)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 8,500 &#8211; 32,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/hepa-filter\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">View Item</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>AHU Motor Rewinding / Repair</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 5,000 &#8211; 15,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/fan-motor\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Get Quote</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>AHU V-Belt Replacement</b> (Set)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 800 &#8211; 2,500</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/v-belts\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Buy Online</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Cooling Coil Repair &#038; Restoration</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 4,000 &#8211; 12,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/cooling-coils\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Inquiry</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4 italic text-center\">* Note: Prices are indicative and vary based on tonnage, blower capacity, and site location in Panchmahal.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PROS AND CONS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Pros and Cons of Professional AHU Maintenance</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-green-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-800\">Advantages (Pros)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Superior Efficiency:</b> Clean coils and balanced fans reduce energy consumption by up to 30%.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Extended System Life:</b> Regular lubrication and servicing double the lifespan of expensive AHU hardware.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Industrial Hygiene:</b> Essential for maintaining dust-free environments in Godhra&#8217;s engineering sectors.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Zero Production Downtime:</b> Predictive maintenance catches failing parts before they cause a plant shutdown.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Improved Indoor Air Quality:</b> Professional filter cleaning removes 99% of airborne contaminants.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Silent Operation:</b> Professional balancing eliminates structural vibrations and blower noise.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Compliance:</b> Maintains factory health and safety standards for export audits.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-red-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-800\">Risks of Neglect (Cons)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Skyrocketing Power Bills:</b> Dirty filters force the fan motor to work harder, consuming excess electricity.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Frequent Breakdowns:</b> Neglecting belts and bearings leads to sudden mechanical failures during peak hours.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Microbial Growth:</b> Stagnant water in drain pans becomes a breeding ground for mold and odors.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Unbalanced Cooling:</b> Damper and coil issues lead to &#8220;hot spots&#8221; in industrial manufacturing bays.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>High Replacement Cost:</b> A completely failed unit is 10 times more expensive than routine maintenance.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Voided Warranty:</b> Manufacturers often reject warranty claims without official service logs.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Fire Hazards:</b> Built-up industrial dust in duct networks can pose a safety risk.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ERROR CODES -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Common AHU Error Codes &#038; Fixes</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">E1: Low Airflow Trip</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Solution:</b> Replace clogged pre-filters. Check for fan belt slippage or motor RPM drop.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">E5: High Pressure Alarm</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Solution:</b> Deep clean the cooling coils. Verify if the VFD frequency matches the design CFM.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">E9: Drain Leak Fault</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Solution:</b> Clear blockages in the condensate pipe. Re-level the drain pan if necessary.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">F0: Motor Overload</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Solution:</b> Inspect motor bearings for friction. Check supply voltage for phase imbalance.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">1. Why are Air Handling Unit services Godhra important for engineering plants?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Godhra&#8217;s engineering sector produces significant dust. Regular AHU servicing prevents this dust from clogging cooling coils, which maintains production precision and worker comfort.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">2. Do you provide AHU AMC in Godhra GIDC?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, Atlas Aircon offers specialized Annual Maintenance Contracts for all units in Godhra GIDC, Halol, and Kalol industrial zones.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">3. Can you repair large double skin AHUs in Halol?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Absolutely. We specialize in maintaining high-capacity industrial AHUs used in large manufacturing plants across the Halol industrial corridor.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">4. How often should industrial AHU filters be cleaned?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">In Godhra&#8217;s industrial climate, we recommend cleaning pre-filters every 15 days and replacing them every 3-6 months depending on usage.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">5. Do you supply genuine AHU spare parts in Panchmahal?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we maintain a complete inventory of genuine belts, motors, and sensors for all major brands like Blue Star, Carrier, and Daikin.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">6. Can you perform cleanroom AHU validation for pharma?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We provide specialized maintenance and filter installation support for pharmaceutical cleanrooms in the Halol and Kalol regions.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">7. Is emergency breakdown support available for Godhra industries?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our priority breakdown service ensures that production-critical AHUs are repaired within hours of a service call.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">8. Do you provide duct cleaning along with AHU service?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we offer integrated solutions including internal AHU deep cleaning and duct network inspection for maximum efficiency.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">9. What are the signs of a failing AHU motor?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Grinding noises from bearings, excessive heat on the motor body, and a significant drop in fan speed are indicators of impending motor failure.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">10. How can I get a quote for my unit in Godhra?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Simply call us at +91 97272 57141 or send a WhatsApp message with your unit details, and we will provide a site audit quote.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREAS SERVED LIST -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white border-t\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">Service Locations Across Godhra &#038; Panchmahal</h2>\n            <div 